<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n14697" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄραμα:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βόρβορος,</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			Hsch.
		</span></i>
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄραμεν:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μένειν,</span> and <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀράμεναι:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡσυχάζειν,</span> Id. (perh. for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠρεμεῖν</span>). <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀράμενοι:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ἀπόχυτα ὕδατα,</span> Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄραμος:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐρῳδιός,</span> Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀράνη:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεσάγκυλον,</span> Id. (order requires
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀραύη</span>). <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">&lt;ἄ&gt;ρανις:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔλαφος,</span> Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀράντισιν:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐρινύσι</span> (<i><span class="en">
			Maced.
		</span></i>), Id.</div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
    <div class="alpheios-lex-alph-source">From <u>
            <u>A Greek-English Lexicon</u>
        </u> (Henry George Liddell, Robert Scott, Oxford, Clarendon Press, 1940) </div>
</div>